GY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different combinations of weapons and abilities, build your tactics \u2014 every decision you make can impact not just the mission, but the fate of all humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/f1dd35031b63c6f3b27a0701735855d2.poster.avif?t=1763244852\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/f1dd35031b63c6f3b27a0701735855d2.webm?t=1763244852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/f1dd35031b63c6f3b27a0701735855d2.mp4?t=1763244852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take command, uncover the truth, and fight back against the invaders. The future is in your hands.</strong></p>","developers":["QuadCom Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/3500a324b7322e94bf6ce1a8ebcec4515083138e/header.jpg?t=1763244852","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3680900/881585/4ad3bbd42707fa60d8b1d128292edb8b015e056c/1750400248/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747384024","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3680900/881585/4ad3bbd42707fa